# Zolo Smart School v1.8.0 — Security Audit, Privacy Analysis & Deployment Pricing

> **Audit Date:** 10 April 2026  
> **Prepared by:** Animazon  
> **Scope:** Full-stack security review (Laravel 10 Backend + Flutter Mobile Apps)  
> **Classification:** CONFIDENTIAL — For Client Decision-Making

---

