## Part C — Standalone Deployment Cost (INR)

> **Pricing basis:** India market rates (April 2026). Assumes one school with up to 3,000 students, 150 staff.

---

### Option 1: One-Time Standalone Deployment (Buy-Once)

#### A. Initial Setup & Deployment Costs

| Item | Description | Cost (₹) |
|---|---|---|
| **Platform License** | CodeCanyon Extended License (one-time) | ₹15,000 |
| **Server Setup (VPS/Cloud)** | DigitalOcean / AWS / Hostinger VPS (4 vCPU, 8GB RAM, 160GB SSD) — 1st year | ₹36,000/year |
| **Domain Name** | .in or .com domain registration (1 year) | ₹800 |
| **SSL Certificate** | Let's Encrypt (Free) or Premium Wildcard SSL | ₹0 – ₹5,000 |
| **Server Configuration** | Ubuntu + Nginx + PHP 8.1 + MySQL 8 + Redis + SSL + Firewall setup | ₹15,000 |
| **Application Deployment** | Install Zolo Smart School, configure multi-DB architecture, set up cron jobs, queue workers | ₹10,000 |
| **Mobile App Customization** | Rebrand Flutter apps (logo, colors, app name, splash screen) | ₹15,000 |
| **Mobile App Publishing** | Google Play ($25 one-time) + Apple App Store ($99/year ≈ ₹8,300) | ₹10,400 |
| **Email Configuration** | SMTP setup (Amazon SES / Mailgun / SendGrid) | ₹3,000 |
| **Payment Gateway Integration** | Razorpay / Stripe configuration + testing | ₹5,000 |
| **Database Backup Automation** | Automated daily backups to S3/Google Drive | ₹5,000 |
| **Security Hardening (Basic)** | Firewall rules, fail2ban, SSH key-only, disable root, header config | ₹8,000 |
| **Data Migration** | Importing existing student/staff data from Excel/CSV/old system | ₹10,000 – ₹25,000 |
| **Training** | Admin + teachers training (2 sessions, 2 hrs each) | ₹8,000 |
| **Documentation** | User manual, admin guide | ₹5,000 |

| **TOTAL ONE-TIME SETUP** | | **₹1,47,200 – ₹1,67,200** |
|---|---|---|

> [!NOTE]
> Approximately **₹1.5L – ₹1.7L** for a complete standalone deployment.

---

